  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Assistance for Cultivation of Medicinal/ Aromatic Crops&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to encourage the cultivation of medicinal and aromatic plants to promote alternative agriculture and improve farmers&amp;#39; income.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant must be a farmer.\n   1. The applicant must be a resident of Gujarat.\n   1. Applicant must possess cultivable land ranging from 0.20 hectares to 4 hectares.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
